<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover">
<title>For You</title>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:ital,wght@0,400;0,600;1,500&family=Jost:wght@400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root{
    --bg:#1F1030;
    --bg2:#2E1A47;
    --plum:#432A61;
    --lilac:#B98FD4;
    --pink:#F0C9E8;
    --cream:#F7F0FA;
    --gold:#E0B771;
    box-sizing:border-box;
    padding-top:env(safe-area-inset-top,0px);
    padding-bottom:env(safe-area-inset-bottom,0px);
  }
  *{box-sizing:inherit;margin:0;padding:0;}
  html{scroll-padding-top:env(safe-area-inset-top,0px);height:100%;}
  body{
    height:100%;
    background:
      radial-gradient(ellipse at 20% 0%, var(--bg2) 0%, var(--bg) 55%),
      var(--bg);
    color:var(--cream);
    font-family:'Jost',sans-serif;
    min-height:100vh;
    display:flex;
    flex-direction:column;
    align-items:center;
    padding:3rem 1.25rem 4rem;
    overflow-x:hidden;
  }
  .stars{
    position:fixed;inset:0;pointer-events:none;z-index:0;
    background-image:
      radial-gradient(1.5px 1.5px at 20% 30%, rgba(247,240,250,.5), transparent),
      radial-gradient(1.5px 1.5px at 70% 15%, rgba(247,240,250,.4), transparent),
      radial-gradient(1px 1px at 85% 55%, rgba(247,240,250,.4), transparent),
      radial-gradient(1.5px 1.5px at 40% 70%, rgba(247,240,250,.3), transparent),
      radial-gradient(1px 1px at 10% 85%, rgba(247,240,250,.4), transparent),
      radial-gradient(1.5px 1.5px at 60% 90%, rgba(247,240,250,.3), transparent);
  }
  header{
    position:relative;z-index:1;
    text-align:center;
    max-width:600px;
    margin-bottom:2.25rem;
  }
  .eyebrow{
    font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;
    font-style:italic;
    font-size:1.05rem;
    color:var(--lilac);
    margin-bottom:.4rem;
  }
  h1{
    font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;
    font-weight:600;
    font-size:clamp(2.2rem,7vw,3.4rem);
    line-height:1.08;
    color:var(--cream);
  }
  h1 em{
    font-style:italic;
    color:var(--pink);
  }
  .sub{
    margin-top:.9rem;
    font-size:.95rem;
    color:rgba(247,240,250,.65);
    line-height:1.6;
  }

  .toggle{
    position:relative;z-index:1;
    display:flex;
    gap:.5rem;
    background:rgba(0,0,0,.18);
    border:1px solid rgba(185,143,212,.35);
    border-radius:999px;
    padding:.3rem;
    margin-bottom:2rem;
  }
  .toggle button{
    font-family:'Jost',sans-serif;
    font-size:.85rem;
    letter-spacing:.02em;
    color:rgba(247,240,250,.7);
    background:transparent;
    border:none;
    padding:.55rem 1.3rem;
    border-radius:999px;
    cursor:pointer;
    transition:background .3s ease, color .3s ease;
  }
  .toggle button.active{
    background:linear-gradient(135deg, var(--lilac), #8E6BB8);
    color:#1F1030;
    font-weight:500;
  }

  .card-wrap{
    position:relative;z-index:1;
    width:100%;
    max-width:620px;
  }
  .letter{
    display:none;
    background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(67,42,97,.55), rgba(46,26,71,.65));
    border:1px solid rgba(185,143,212,.3);
    border-radius:4px;
    padding:clamp(1.8rem,5vw,3rem);
    box-shadow:0 30px 60px -20px rgba(0,0,0,.5);
    animation:fadeIn .5s ease;
  }
  .letter.active{display:block;}
  @keyframes fadeIn{
    from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(8px);}
    to{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0);}
  }
  .letter .mark{
    font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;
    font-style:italic;
    color:var(--gold);
    font-size:1rem;
    margin-bottom:1.1rem;
  }
  .letter h2{
    font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;
    font-weight:600;
    font-size:clamp(1.6rem,4.5vw,2.1rem);
    margin-bottom:1.3rem;
    color:var(--pink);
  }
  .letter p{
    font-size:1rem;
    line-height:1.85;
    color:rgba(247,240,250,.92);
    margin-bottom:1.1rem;
    max-width:62ch;
  }
  .letter .sign{
    margin-top:1.6rem;
    font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;
    font-style:italic;
    font-size:1.25rem;
    color:var(--lilac);
  }
  .divider{
    width:46px;height:1px;
    background:linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, var(--lilac), transparent);
    margin:1.5rem 0;
  }

  footer{
    position:relative;z-index:1;
    margin-top:2.5rem;
    font-size:.78rem;
    color:rgba(247,240,250,.4);
    text-align:center;
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){
    .letter{animation:none;}
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="stars"></div>

<header>
  <div class="eyebrow">a little something, across the distance</div>
  <h1>You are <em>mine</em>,<br>and this love is strong.</h1>
  <p class="sub">Two letters for you — pick where you want to start.</p>
</header>

<div class="toggle">
  <button class="active" onclick="showLetter('celebrate', this)">Celebration</button>
  <button onclick="showLetter('apology', this)">Apology</button>
</div>

<div class="card-wrap">

  <div class="letter active" id="celebrate">
    <div class="mark">for the one who is mine</div>
    <h2> my princess </h2>
    <p>Sometimes I sit and think about everything we’ve been through, and honestly, it amazes me that we made it this far. Our journey hasn’t always been easy. We’ve had our misunderstandings, our arguments, our difficult moments, and times when things felt like they were becoming too much. But somehow, through all of it, we kept choosing each other.</p>
    <p>And I think that’s what makes what we have so special to me.</p>
    <p>I’ll never forget what it felt like finally closing the distance and coming to see you. It honestly felt so unreal. I was excited, nervous, shy, and honestly didn’t even know how to act because the person I had spent so much time talking to and loving was finally standing right in front of me. After all the waiting, all the conversations, all the distance, I finally got to see you for real. It was one of those moments where everything just felt surreal..</p>
    <p>And then, spending time with you felt even better than I imagined. Every little moment we shared, every conversation, every laugh, every time I was simply beside you I loved it. I found myself wishing time would slow down because I didn't want those moments to end.</p>
    <p>Being with you made me realize just how much you mean to me. There’s something different about being able to look at the person you love, hold them, spend time with them, and actually create memories together after having so much distance between you. It made everything feel more real.

I’m genuinely happy that somehow, through everything, you became mine and I became yours. I’m grateful for you, for us, and for every part of this journey that brought us to where we are now.

I know I haven’t done an official proposal yet, and I know I probably owe you that moment properly. 😂 But even without that official moment, I want you to know that my feelings for you have never been something I take lightly. I chose you, and I continue to choose you.

We’ve already fought through so much together, and I don't want the hard moments to define our story. I want them to be proof that when things got difficult, we still found our way back to each other.

I don’t know exactly what every chapter ahead of us will look like, but I know who I want beside me while we write it.

Thank you for loving me. Thank you for staying. Thank you for every memory we’ve made and every moment we still have ahead of us.

And when I finally give you that official proposal, I hope you remember that it wasn’t the day I decided I wanted you. I had already known for a long time.

I love you, and I’m so grateful that our story is ours.</p>
    <div class="divider"></div>
    <p>So today isn't about pretending the hard parts away. It's about telling you plainly: you make the waiting worth it. Every rough patch, every mismatched time zone, every "I miss you" typed out at 2am has only ever proven how much I mean this. You are patient with me in ways I don't always deserve, and steady in ways that keep me steady too.</p>
    <p>Thank you for choosing this hard, beautiful, long distance kind of love with me. I am counting down to the day there's no ocean, no flight, no screen between us  just you, me, and finally, no more goodnight calls instead of goodnight kisses.</p>
    <div class="sign">Yours, always your foxy</div>
  </div>

  <div class="letter" id="apology">
    <div class="mark">for when I get it wrong</div>
    <h2>I'm sorry, and I mean it</h2>
    <p>Baby, I’m really sorry for how I acted last night and earlier today. I know I was moody and distant because I let my trust issues and jealousy get the better of me, and you didn’t deserve that from me.

I should’ve opened up to you instead of letting my insecurities affect the way I treated you. I’m also sorry about this constant issue (I know I’ve said I’m sorry that I’m going to work on these issues and do better, but I won’t lie to you it’s not working , the way I love you increases daily and as it increases my issues gets bigger and I get the feeling like I need to protect my girl from every man, I know I make it seem like cause you’re my girl you shouldn’t have male friends , that’s not true)

I love you, and I don’t ever want my fears to make you question how much you mean to me. I trust what we have, and I’m going to do my part to build that trust even more. I’m sorry, baby. ❤️
    <div class="divider"></div>
    <p>I'm not asking you to pretend it didn't happen. I'm asking for the chance to actually do better  to listen more carefully, to show up more consistently, and to make sure my actions catch up to how much I say I love you.</p>
    <p>You are worth getting this right. Thank you for your patience while I do.</p>
    <div class="sign">I love you — truly, and I'm sorry</div>
  </div>

</div>

<footer>made with you in mind, my baby thanks for the boyfriends day gift(and alllow me get you something, i know you feel like you dont need it but come on baby)</footer>

<script>
function showLetter(id, btn){
  document.querySelectorAll('.letter').forEach(el => el.classList.remove('active'));
  document.querySelectorAll('.toggle button').forEach(b => b.classList.remove('active'));
  document.getElementById(id).classList.add('active');
  btn.classList.add('active');
}
</script>
</body>
</html>
